	(text "ErgoSwiss / LOGICDATA COMPACT-e-3-VAL desk interface\nJ1 wire colours: 1 brown GND, 2 red +5V, 3 white UP, 4 yellow DOWN,\n5 black data out, 6 green HS3 (spare), 7 blue HS4 (spare).\nButton lines are ACTIVE HIGH: the opto ties them to +5V, exactly as\nthe panel button does, so the original panel keeps working.\nData line is 1000 baud 9N1; a plain 8N1 UART reads it as 0xFE <byte>,\nheight_inches = (245 - byte) / 2.  Measured travel 27.0 - 38.0 in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
